{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jiji stole a forbidden artifact, now he must stay in his bubble, until he can pay off his debt to The One. Help Jiji collect enough money by completing\u00a0 5 worlds, and free him from his confines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996590/extras/768ace55336d51cd80207f231633ff42.poster.avif?t=1757521995\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996590/extras/768ace55336d51cd80207f231633ff42.webm?t=1757521995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996590/extras/768ace55336d51cd80207f231633ff42.mp4?t=1757521995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way through a multitude of levels across 5 worlds, featuring a unique core mechanic, dozens of interactable, tight controls, difficult jumps, followed by even harder jumps.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No walking or running, you can only propel yourself through bombs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of interactable, which change how your character moves and behaves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All across 5 varied worlds, each featuring new as well as recurring mechanics and powerups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging yet rewarding difficulty.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996590/extras/499efadfca253d9987401c2ed045798a.poster.avif?t=1757521995\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996590/extras/499efadfca253d9987401c2ed045798a.webm?t=1757521995\" typ